\subsection{Research attempt}
\paragraph{Model, date and investigated scope.}
OpenAI GPT-6 Astra (configured model \texttt{gpt-6-astra}), ultra reasoning; generated 11 October 2026. Derives the barotropic ambiguity of temperature and PV uniqueness with boundary data in a linear quasigeostrophic slab.

